<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EZR" style="id">Ezra</book>
  <para style="h">Ezra</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ezra</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezra</para>
  <para style="mt">Ezra</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Persia mi Cyrus in kumpilianpa a sep, a kum khat kumin Topa in kamsaang Jeremiah tungtawn a, a thusonte taangtungsak hi. Topa ii thotna taw a nuai a thupiakna teng Cyrus in ama ukna ngamsung theampo ah a nging takin a sim tu lai khat at in thaak hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Hisia in Persia kumpilianpa Cyrus ii thupiakna ahi hi. Vantung Pathian, Topa in leitung bup uk tu in keima hong koi zo a, Judah ngam Jerusalem ah ama atu biakinn khat sa tu in vaipuak hong pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama mi ahi note theampo taw Pathian hong omkhawm tahen. Note Jerusalem ah pai tavun a, Jerusalem ah a kibia Pathian, Israel te ii Pathian, Topa ii Biakinnpi sa kik vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Saltaang a mite a cia kik natu in hu tu a kul le, a innpaamte in amate hi bangin hu tu hi. Tua a innpaamte in ngunn le khamh, nguai an le vanh pua nganhingte sia, Jerusalem Pathian Biakinnpi sungah a piak tu biakpiaknate taw amate tungah pia khawm tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciang Judah le Benjamin namte sung pan bee le phung lutangte, thiampite le Levi te, tuaciang Pathian ii a thin a phawnsak dangte theampo in Jerusalem ah, Topa Biakinnpi sa kik tu in kithoai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A innpaamte theampo in na tam mama pia in amate hu uh hi: ngunn taw kivawt vanhzakte, khamh, nguai ante, vanh pua nganhingte, na manpha dangte le Biakinnpi atu in biakpiaknate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cyrus kumpilianpa in Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa ii Jerusalem Biakinnpi sung pan a laaksak, ama ii pathiante biakinn sungah a koi kuang le hai te amate pia kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in tua teng Judah ngamukmangpa Sheshbazzar a piak tu in tepteena lai a vawt kumpi sumkeampi pa Mithredath tungah aap hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a piak vanhte a nuai a bang ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khamh le ngunn taw kivawt khawbeamte le nadang tuatuamte a vekpi in 5,400 pha a, Babylon pan Jerusalem ah ama le a dang saltaangte a cia uh ciang Sheshbazzar in tua teng ciapui hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saltaang tam mama te in Babylon nusia in Jerusalem le Judah ngam a khuapi tek ah ciakik uh hi. Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa in tualai ah thongtaak tu in a mat pan kipan amate a innkuan a innkuanin Babylon ngam ah saltaangin teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lampuite sia Zerubbabel, Joshua, Nehemiah, Seraiah, Reelaiah, Mordecai, Bilshan, Mispar, Bigvai, Rehum le Baanah te ahi uh hi. Hisia saltanna pan a ciakik Israel bee le phungte sung pan a bee a phung zui in mi phaza tepteena ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Parosh - 2,172 Shephatiah - 372 Arah - 775 Pahath Moab (Jeshua le Joab suan le paalte) - 2,812 Elam - 1,254 Zattu - 945 Zaccai - 760 Bani - 642 Bebai - 623 Azgad - 1,222 Adonikam - 666 Bigvai - 2,056 Adin - 454 Ater (Hezekiah zong kici hi) - 98 Bezai - 323 Jorah - 112 Hashum - 223 Gibbar - 95
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A taanghpupite ii teen ngeina a nuai a khuate ah a teang mite zongh cia kik uh hi: Bethlehem - 123 Netophah - 56 Anathoth - 128 Azmaveth - 42 Kiriath Jearim, Chephirah le Beeroth - 743 Ramah le Geba - 621 Michmash - 122 Bethel le Ai - 223 Nebo - 52 Magbish - 156 A dang Elam - 1,254 Harim - 320 Lod, Hadid le Ono - 725 Jericho - 345 Senaah - 3,630
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hi sia saltaang a cia kik thiampi bee le phungte tepteena ahi hi: Jedaiah (Jeshua ii suan le paalte) - 973 Immer - 1,052 Pashhur - 1,247 Harim - 1,017
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Saltaang a ciakik Levi bee le phungte: Jeshua le Kadmiel (Hodaviah suan le paalte) - 74 Biakinn la sate (Asaph suan le paalte) - 128 Biakinn cingte (Shallum, Ater, Talmon, Akkub, Hatita le Shobai ii suan le paalte) - 139 ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Saltaang a cia kik biakinn naseamte ii bee le phung te: Ziha, Hasupha, Tabbaoth, Keros, Siaha, Padon, Lebanah, Hagabah, Akkub, Hagab, Shamlai, Hanan, Giddel, Gahar, Reaiah, Rezin, Nekoda, Gazzam, Uzza, Paseah, Besai, Asnah, Meunim, Nephisim Bakbuk, Hakupha, Harhur Bazluth, Mehida, Harsha, Barkos, Sisera, Temah, Neziah le Hatipha te ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Saltaang a cia kik Solomon ii naseamte ii bee le phungte in: Sotai, Hassophereth, Peruda, Jaalah, Darkon, Giddel, Shephatiah, Hattil, Pochereth Hazzebaim le Ami te ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Saltaang a cia kik biakinn naseamte le Solomon ii naseamte ii suan le paalte a vekpi in 392 pha uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tel Melah, Tel Harsha, Cherub, Addan le Immer khuate pan a cia kikte sia Delaiah, Tobiah le Nekoda te ii bee le phungte hi a, 652 pha uh hi; ahizong amate in Israel suan le paalte ahi uh hunlam lak thei ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />A nuai a thiampi bee le phungte in a pianna khang ngui a lak tepteena sia mu zo ngawl uh hi: Habaiah, Hakkoz, le Barzillai ahi hi. (Barzillai thiampi bee le phung pianna taanghpupi in Gilead ngam Barzillai bee le phung pan numei khat teenpui a, a sunghpa ii bee le phung min la hi). A taanghpupite sia a kuate ci lak thei ngawl ahikom amate sia thiampi tu in kisaang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Jew ngamukmangpa in amate tungah Urim le Thummim a zangh thei thiampi khat a om mateng in Pathian a kipia ante ne thei ngawl tu nu hi ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Saltanna pan a cia kik theampo 42,360 Amate ii naseampa le numei - 7,337 Music thiam, pa le numei - 200 Siphu - 736 Laa - 245 Kalaoh - 435 Laano - 6720 pha uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Jerusalem ah om Topa ii Biakinnpi ah saltaangte a thet uh ciang, bee le phungte lampui pawlkhat in a mun lui ma ah Biakinnpi a kisak kik natu panpui in thinzaw piakkhiatnate pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Amate in hi nasep a sep natu in a piak zawk za tek pia in, a vekpi kingawm khamh kilogramme 500, ngunn kilogramme 2,800 le thiampite atu in puantual silh 100 ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Thiampite, Levi te, le mi pawlkhatte Jerusalem ahibuale tua khua nai ah teang uh hi. Music thiamte, biakinn cingte le biakinn naseamte sia a naina khuate ah teang uh hi; tuaciang a taanglai Israel te sia a taanghpupite teenna khuate ah teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A tha sali tha in Israel mite a khua tek ah teang siat hi. Tua zawkciang amate a vekpi in Jerusalem ah kikhawm uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jehozadak ii tapa Joshua, a thiampi puite le Shealtiel ii tapa Zerubbabel le a beete teng in Pathian ii mihing Moses ii Thukham sungah a ki at hilnate bangin sangaw biakpiaknate a hal thei natu in Israel ii Pathian biaknatau sa kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Saltanna pan a cia kikte in tua ngam ah a teang mite kiita ahitazong, amate in biaknatau sia a om maksakna mun ma ah sa kik uh hi. Tua zawkciang amate ii a vawt ngei zing le nitak sangaw biakpiaknate tua tungah hal tu in khatvei ma kipan kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in zui tu ngeina om bangin Buk Poai khaam a; ni khat sim atu a kisamh babang tua ni in biakpiakna pia uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuaban ah amate in a piak tawntung pum bup meihal sangaw biakpiakna, Tha Thak Poai biakpiakna le a vawt ngengei Topa biak kikhopna dang teng theampo le Topa tungah amate thin zawna taw a piak biakpiaknate theampo zongh pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mipite in Biakinnpi sakkik tu kipan ngawl lai hikale, amate in a tha salina ni khat ni in Topa tungah meihal sangaw biakpiaknate kipan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mipite in suangciangte le lettamate a piak tu sum khia in, tuipi lam tawnin Joppa khua ah a kipua tu Lebanon pan Cedar thingte the natu in, Tyre le Sidon khuapite ah an le tui, olive thaute pia si uh hi. Hite theampo Persia kumpilianpa Cyrus ii thukimna la in kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuabangin Jerusalem Biakinnpi sak natu munah amate a ciakik kum, a tha nii tha in nasep kipan uh hi. Zerubbabel, Joshua le a taanglai ngamsung a mipuite, thiampite le Levi mite, a tatakin saltanna pan Jerusalem ah a cia kikte theampo in sep pui tek hi. Kum kul le a tungsia Levi te theampo Biakinnpi sak kikna ah nasep ki uksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Levi mi Jeshua le a tapate le a mealheakte, tuaciang Kadmiel le a tapate (Hodaviah ii bee le phung) in Biakinnpi a sak kikna uk khawm uh hi. (Amate sia Henadad bee le phung pan Levi te in hu uh hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Inn sate ii Biakinn tawdap a vawt kipat ciang puantual silh Thiampite in a khut ah lemle toai in dinmun la uh a, Asaph bee le phung Levi te in daalkopsai taw tua munah ding uh hi. Amate in David kumpipa hun pan a kihilnate bangin Topa pok uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in hi Topa pokna la sa kikik hi: “ Topa pha hi, Israel a itna kip tawntung hi.” A kuama po in a tha neiza tek taw au in Topa pok uh hi, banghang ziam cile Biakinnpi tawdap a vawt kipan zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khanghaam thiampite, Levi te le bee le phung lutangte tam ma in a masa Biakinnpi mu ngei zo a, hi Biakinnpi tawdap a kipha a mu uh ciang amate au in kap uh hi. Ahizong tua munah a om dangte lungdamin au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate aw sa taw ngamlum mama in a khuala na pan kiza thei ahiciang kuama in kaa na aw maw lungdamna aw maw khen thei ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah le Benjamin mite ii ngalte in saltaang a cia kikte ii Israel te ii Pathian, Topa Biakinnpi a sak kikna thu za uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahiciang amate pai a Zerubbabel le a bee a phung lutangte taw a kimu uh ciang, “Ko zongh Biakinnpi sakna ah hong kihelsak tavun. Noma biak Pathian ma kote in bia khu hi, Assyria kumpilianpa Esarhaddon in hi lai ah teang tu in hong paisak pan kipan ama tungah sangaw biakpiakna pia khu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zerubbabel, Joshua le a bee a phung lutangte in amate tungah, “ Topa kote Pathian biakinn sak natu in nong hu tu ka kisamh bua uh hi. Persia kumpilianpa Cyrus ii hong thupiakna bangin koma teng ma in ka sa tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaciang tua ngam sungah a teang mite in a sak ngawl natu in Jew te thinkiam sakin lauthawn tu hanciam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate a langpan natu in Persia kumpi uliante zongh sumnguk pia uh hi. Amate in Cyrus kumpi maan hun sung theampo le Darius kumpi maan hun dongin tubangin langpan tan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Xerxes kumpilianpa maan hun a kipat ciang Judah le Jerusalem ah a teangte ii ngalte in amate a langpanna lai pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Persia kumpilianpa Artaxerxes maan hun ciangin Bishlam, Mithredath, Tabeel le a pawlpuite in kumpilianpa tungah laithak at kik uh hi. Tua laithak sia Aramaic lai taw in ki at a, a kisim ciang pheen kik kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngamukmangpa Rehum le ngamsung thuzeakpi Shimshai te zongh in Jerusalem khua thu taw kisai kumpilianpa Artaxerxes tungah a nuai a bangin laithak at uh hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ngamukmangpa Rehum le ngamsung thuzeakpi Shimshai, a pawlpuite, thukhente le Elam ngam sungah a om Erech, Babylon le Susa khuate ah a teang ulian dang theampote tung pan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuaciang a lian le a thahat Ashurbanipal ii amate inn pan a khiin Samaria khuapi sung le Euphrates nitumna ngamsung mundang ah a teensak midangte theampo tung panin kong thaak khop uh lai ahi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A laithak sia a nuai a bang hi: “Euphrates nitumna sangah a teang na naseamte in kumpilianpa Artaxerxes tungah lai kong thaak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Nangma vaanglian kumpipa in, na ngam tuatuam panin hi mun ah hong pai Jew te ii Jerusalem khua ah teang a, a ngilo khuapi le kumpi leedo thei, tua khuapi a saat kikna thu he le te kong oai uh hi. Amate in luphung cian tu kipan zo a, hai ngawlin zo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vaanglian kumpipa awng, hi khuapi kisa kikin a luphungte kimanthiang le a mite in phiangshia piak tawlnga in, na kumpi sum tum kiam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tu in kote sia nangma a vaanglian kumpipa khutnuai ah a seamte ka hi uh ciang, hi bangin a pian tu sia mu nuam ngawl khu hi, tua hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />na taanghpupite nusiat thu tepteena laibu sungah na kat kik tu in ngaisutna kong pia uh hi. Tuabangin kan kik le te hi khuapi sia kumpi leedo tawntung khuapi a hina le taanghlai hun a kipan kumpite le ngam ukte a buaisakna thu na mu tu hi. A mite sia uk hak tawntung hi. Tua hangin a khua kilalsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi khua kisaat kikin a luphungte kizo thiang thong le vaanglian kumpipa nangma in Euphrates nitumna ngam teng uk zo nawn ngawl tu ci thu telthiang khu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpilianpa in hi bangin lai thuk hi: “Ngam uk mangpa Rehum, ngamsung thuzeakpi Shimshai le Samaria le Euphrates nitumna sangah a teang pawl le lawmte awng kong paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Nong laithak kipheen kik in keima hong kisim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A thu kan tu in ka sawl a, thu a kat ciang nidang tawngh hun pan Jerusalem sia kumpi a langpan tawntung a, a leedote le thu nawngkai vawtte taw a kidimna kimu takpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A thahat kumpite maang in Euphrates nitumna sang theampo uk in shia le phiangshia khon uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahikom thu kong piak kik mateng tua mite in khuapi a sakkik nawn ngawl natu in thupia tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka ngam phattuam nate a kilalsak ngawl natu in thakhat thu in tuasia seam paih vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hi Artaxerxes ii laithak sia Rehum, Shimshai le a pawlpuite tungah a kisim po ciang amate Jerusalem ah manlang takin pai in Jew te khuapi a sakkik sia zawthawk thu taw tawlngasak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Biakinnpi sakkik sia kitawlngasak a, Persia kumpilianpa Darius ii kumpi maan a kum nii kum dong bangma seam ngawlin omcip hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hun lai in kamsaang niite ahi Haggai le Iddo ii tapa Zechariah in Judah le Jerusalem ah a teang Jew te tungah Israel ii Pathian min suangin thu son kipan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Shealtiel ii tapa Zerubbabel le Jehozadak ii tapa Joshua te in a thusonte a zaak uh ciang Jerusalem Biakinnpi sakkik kipan a, kamsaangte nii in hu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thakhat thu phialma in Euphrates nitumna sang ngamukmangpa Tattenai, Shethar Bozenai le a seppui uliante Jerusalem ah pai in, “Hi Biakinnpi sak tu le a sungah vanh teng a nguan tu in akua in thu hong pia ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in Biakinnpi sakna ah a hu teng ii min zongh dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahizong Pathian in Jew lampuite mitsuan nginge a, Persia uliante in kumpilianpa Darius tungah laithak in a zo kik mateng bangma law ngawl tu in khensat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in hi bangin kumpilianpa tungah thu zasak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Darius kumpilianpa awng, thinnopna taw ngam uk thei ta in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Nangma Kumpipa awng, kote Judah ngam sungah ka pai uh a, a lian Pathian ii Biakinnpi sia suangtum lian mamate taw kisa in, a pang zongh thing pangluaite a kithung in ka mu uh a, tua thu he lete kong oai uh hi. A nasep belcing mama a, ngaih vahuut uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuasia ciang akua ii thu taw hi Biakinnpi kisa kik a, a vanhte kinguan ziam, hong son natu in a lampuite ka dongh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi nasep a lampuite akua teng ziam kong son thei natu in amate min zongh ka dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Amate in, ‘Kote vantung le leitung Pathian ii naseamte hi in, a vaanglian Israel kumpipa khat ii kum tam mama lai in a sak phit le vanh a kinguan Biakinnpi sia a sa kik ka hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahizong ka taanghpupite in vantung Pathian thin uuksak ahiciang, Chaldean kumpi ngui sung pan Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in amate zosak hi. Biakinnpi sia kisia sakin tua mipite Babylon ah sal in kila hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Cyrus kumpilianpa in Babylon kumpilianpa ahi zawk a kum khat kumin Biakinnpi a kisak kik natu thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar ii Jerusalem Biakinnpi pan a laak Babylon biakinn ah a koi biakinn a zak khamh le ngunn, Biakinn vanh zakte puuapha kik hi. Cyrus in tua teng Judah ngamukmang tu in a koi Sheshbazzar tungah pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua kumpilianpa in tua vanhte la a, Jerusalem Biakinnpi ah koi kikin nidang a sakna ngei mun ma ah Biakinnpi a sakkik natu in ama sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Sheshbazzar hong pai in a tawdap phaasak hi; tua hun pan kipan tu dong Biakinnpi kisa zom a, ahizong kiman ngawl lai hi,’ ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tu in, Nang Vaanglianpa, na lung a kim le Babylon kumpi thu tepteenate sungah Cyrus in hi Jerusalem Biakinnpi sakkik natu in thu a piak le a piak ngawl kansak in a, hi thu taw kisai nangma deina bang hong zasak ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaciang Darius kumpilianpa in Babylon khua ah a kikeam kumpite thu tepteena laibu sungah tua thute kan tu in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahizong Media ngamsung Ecbatana khua sungah a nuai a bang thu tepteena a om laizial khat kimu hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ama ii kumpi maan zawk a kum khat kum in Cyrus kumpilianpa in sangaw biakpiakna le meihal biakpiakna mun tu in Jerusalem Biakinnpi a kisak kik natu thupia hi. Biakinnpi sia metre 27 saangin metre 27 zai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pangte suangtum dawl thum a cian simin thing dawl khat taw kisa tu hi. A sum bo theampo kumpi sum sung pan kipia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar kumpipa ii Jerusalem Biakinnpi pan Babylon ah a paipui khamh le ngunn, vanh zakte zongh Jerusalem Biakinnpi sung a omna ngei tek ah kikoi kik tu hi,” ci in a kitepteena mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Darius in a nuai a bangin zasak kik hi: “Euphrates nitumna ngamuk mangpa Tattenai, Shethar Bozenai le Euphrates nitumna ngam ah a om a nasep pui uliante awng, “Biakinnpi pan kiheam vun a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Biakinn sakna nawngkaisak heak vun. Judah ngamukmangpa le Jew lampuite in Pathian Biakinnpi sia a om na ngei ma ah sa kiksak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate ii a sak kikna na hu natu uh in hi lai sungah thu kong pia hi. Hi nasep a kisuangsamh ngawl natu in Euphrates nitumna sang pan phiangshia a kinga kumpi sum sung pan a bona teng theampo manlang takin kipiaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jerusalem ah a om thiampite ii ni simin kisamh hi hong ci pawpo peal ngawlin pia tu nu hi: vantung Pathian tungah meihal biakpiak natu in khuitalnote, tuute ahibuale tuunote ahibuale zungtaang, ci, sapittui ahibuale olive thau ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vantung Pathian ii a saan thei tu in sangaw biakpiakna a piak thei natu le keima le ka tapate atu in thupha nong nget thei natu in hisia sep tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua banah hi thupiakna a zui ngawl a om le a inn zawlliang khat kidawkeaksak tu a, a mong khat kizumin tuaciang ama pumpi kisunlet tu hi. A inn sia ninthuk kisua tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama a kibiak natu mun Jerusalem khuapi a teal Pathian in hi thupiakna nial a, tua Biakinnpi a lalsak nuam kumpi ahibuale minam peuma susia tahen. Keima Darius in hi thu kong pia zo hi. Ka thupiak sia na zui siat tu uh ahi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuasia ciang ngamukmang Tattenai, Shethar Bozenai le a naseppui uliante in kumpilianpa thupiak bang linlian in vawt siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jew lampuite in kamsaang Haggai le Zechariah te ii hanthotna taw a Biakinnpi sak ngai tawto uh hi. Amate in Biakinnpi sia Israel te ii Pathian le Persia kumpiliante ahi Cyrus, Darius le Artaxerxes te ii thupiak bangin zo thiang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in Darius ii kumpilian a sep zawk a kum luk kum Adar tha, ni thum ni in Biakinnpi zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Israel mite — thiampite, Levi te le saltanna pan a cia kik midang theampote in lungdam takin Biakinnpi aap uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Biakinnpi aapna in amate in khuital 100, tuu 200, le tuuno 400 te sangaw biakpiakna in pia a, Israel nam sim atu mawphel biakpiakna in keal khat tek, keal 12 pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in Moses laibu sungah kihilna om bangin Jerusalem biakinn naseam tu in thiampite le Levi te zongh kaikhawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Saltanna pan hong cia kik mite in a kum kik, a tha masa, ni sawm le ni li ni in Paisan Poai khaam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thiampite le Levi te theampo in amate le amate kithiansua in a zeksa om bangin thiangtho uh hi. Levi te in hong cia kik mite theampo atu le thiampite le amate mama atu in Paisan Poai sangaw biakpiakna in ngannote ngo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua biakpiakna sate saltanna pan hong cia kik Israel te theampo le tua ngam ah a teang doai biate ii biakna nusia a Israel ii Topa Pathian bia tu in hong paite in ne uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ni sali sung lungdam takin Tol saw ngawl Anluum Poai khaam uh hi. Israel te ii Pathian ii Biakinnpi a sakkikna ah a hu natu Topa in Assyria kumpilianpa sia Jew te ngup nopna thin neisak ahikom amate lungdamna taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum tam mama a ngei zawk, Artaxerxes sia Persia kumpilianpa a sua ciang Ezra kici mihing khat om hi. Ama in a taanghpupite Thiampi Lianbel Aaron dong a kat kik ciang a nuai a bang hi: Ezra sia Seriah ii tapa, Seriah sia Azariah ii tapa, Azariah sia Hilkiah ii tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hilkiah sia Shallum ii tapa, Shallum sia Zadok ii tapa, Zadok sia Ahitub ii tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahitub sia Amariah ii tapa, Amariah sia Azariah ii tapa, Azariah sia Meraioth ii tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Meraioth sia Zerahiah ii tapa, Zerahiah sia Uzzi ii tapa, Uzzi sia Bukki ii tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bukki sia Abishua ii tapa, Abishua sia Phinehas ii tapa, Phinehas sia Eleazar ii tapa, Eleazar sia Aaron ii tapa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ezra sia lai thiam mipil khat hi a, Topa, Israel te ii Pathian ii Moses tungah a piak Thukham teng he sitset hi. Ezra in Topa a Pathian thupha nga ahikom, a nget theampo kumpilianpa in pia hi. Artaxerxes ii kumpi maan hun a kum sali kumin Ezra sia thiampite, Levi te, biakinn music thiamte, biakinn cingte le naseamte a kihel Israel te honkhat taw Babylon pan Jerusalem zuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in a tha masabel tha, a ni khat ni in Babylon nusia in, Pathian ii huna taw in a tha nga tha, ni khat ni in Jerusalem theng uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ezra in a nuntakna sia Topa Thukham sinna, a sinsate zuina, le Israel mite tungah thukham le ngeina theampo hilna in zangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Artaxerxes in a nuai a lai sia Topa ii Israel tungah a piak thukhamte le thupiakte a he sitset, thiampi le lai thiam mipil, Ezra tungah pia hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Kumpilianpa Artaxerxes tung pan Vantung Pathian Thukham a he mipil thiampi Ezra tungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ka kumpi ukna ngamsung theampo ah a om Israel mite theampo, thiampite le Levi te Jerusalem ah a cia nuam peuma nangma taw a pai thei natu in thu ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima le ka thudok salite in nangma muangin hong ki aap, na Pathian Thukham teng Judah le Jerusalem ah bangza ciang pha takin kizui ci thu kan tu in kong sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel te ii Pathian, Jerusalem Biakinnpi a nei pa tungah keima le ka thudokte ii ka piak nop uh khamh le ngunn biakpiakna teng na keng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel mite le a thiampite ii Jerusalem Pathian Biakinnpi atu in a piak piakkhiatnate le noma ii Babylon ngamsung pan na kaikhop uh ngunn le khamh theampo zongh paipui tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Hi dangka teng khuital, tuutal, tuuno, antang le sapittui leina in pha takpi na zangh tu a, tua vanhte Jerusalem Biakinnpi biaknatau tungah na pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A taanglai ngunn le khamhte na Pathian ii deina taw kizui in nangma le na ngamsung mite deina po ah zangh thei tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Biakinn sung nasepna ah zak tu in nangma hong kipia vanhzakte theampo Jerusalem khua Pathian tungah pia tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaciang Biakinnpi atu in na kisap dangte sia kumpi sum le vanh manpha sung panin nga thei tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Keima in thiampi le Vantung Pathian ii Thukham a he, mipil Ezra ii hong nget theampo thakhat thu piak tu in Euphrates Nitumna Ngam sungah a om sum lamsang a len uliante theampo thu ka pia hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />piak tu a kiciangtan za sia, ngunn kilogramme 3,400, zungtaang kilogramme 10,000, sapittui litre 2,000, olive thau litre 2,000, le ci al a kisamh zaza hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vantung Pathian in a Biakinnpi atu in a tulmawk theampo pha takin pia nanak tu nu hi; tuasia in keima tung le kei zawkciang ngamukte tungah a thin a uuk ngei nawn ngawl natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nangma in thiampite, Levi te, music thiamte, a cingte, naseamte ahibuale Biakinnpi taw a kizom midang khat pawpo tung pan shia na khon thei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Nangma Ezra in na Pathian hong piaksa ciimna zanghin, na Pathian Thukham bangin a nungta Euphrates Nitumna sang mite theampo a uk tu ngamukte le Thukhente panmun na pia tu hi. A he ngawl laite theampo tungah tua Thukham na hil hamtang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mihing khat pawpo in na Pathian thukhamte, ahibuale kumpi ngamsung upadi te a zui buale ama sia thidaan ahizong, hawlkhiatna taw ahibuale a na theampo laaksakna ahibuale, thongtaaksakna taw thakhat thu in daan kipia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ezra in, “Ih taanghpupite ii Pathian, Topa pok vun! Ama in kumpilianpa sia Topa ii Jerusalem Biakinnpi, hi bangin patoai nopna thin neisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pathian ii thuthiamna taw kumpilianpa, a thudokte le a thahat ulian theampote ii maipha ka nga zo hi; Topa ka Pathian in thinletna hong pia zo a, keima taw cia khawm tu in Israel bee le phung lampui tam mama ka zol thei hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hiteng sia Artaxerxes ii kumpilian a sep ciangin Babylon saltanna pan Jerusalem ah Ezra taw a ciakik bee le phung lutangte hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Phinehas bee le phung pan Gershom Ithamar bee le phung pan Daniel David bee le phung pan Shecaniah ii tapa Hattush, Parosh bee le phung pan Zechariah le a bee a phung pan pasal 150 (a pianna innkuan tepteena lai om hi) Pahath Moab bee le phung pan Zerahiah ii tapa Eliehoenai taw pasal 200 Zattu bee le phung pan Jahaziel ii tapa Shecaniah taw pasal 300 Adin bee le phung pan Jonathan ii tapa Ebed taw pasal 50 Elam bee le phung pan Athaliah ii tapa Jeshaiah taw pasal 70 Shephatiah bee le phung pan Michael ii tapa Zebadiah taw pasal 80 Joab bee le phung pan Jehiel ii tapa Obadiah taw pasal 218 Bani bee le phung pan Josiphiah ii tapa Shelomith taw pasal 160 Bebai bee le phung pan Bebai ii tapa Zechariah taw pasal 28 Azgad bee le phung pan Hakkatan ii tapa Johanan taw pasal 110 Adonikam bee le phung pan Eliphelet, Jeuel le Shemaiah taw pasal 60 (A khak sang a ciate hi) Bigvai bee le phung pan Uthai le Zaccur taw pasal 70
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahava a kitotawm Tuiluam hui ah mihon bup ka kaikhawm a, tua munah ni thum sung ngiaphual ka saat uh hi. Tua mihon sungah thiampite om a, ahizong Levi te ka mu bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaciang lampui kuate: Eliezer, Ariel, Shemaiah, Elnathan, Jarib, Elnathan, Nathan, Zechariah le Meshullam le sya niite ahi Joiarib le Elnathan te ka sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Casiphia khua taangpi lutang ahi Iddo kungah amate ka paisak a, ama le a pawlte, biakinn naseamte in Biakinnpi sungah Pathian naseam tu mihing hong puak natu ka ngensak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian ii thuthiamna tungtawnin amate in Mahli bee le phung sung pan Levi te a pilvang Sherebiah hong puak a, a tapate le a suapuipate sawm le liat taw hong pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in Merari bee le phung sung pan Hashabiah le Jeshaiah te zongh a mealheakte kul taw hong puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua banah Levi te a hu tu in David kumpipa le a uliante ii a taanghpupite pan nasep a piaksa biakinn naseam 220 om hi. Amate min teng zongh kikhum siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kitotawm Ahava Tuiluam hui ah ka vekpi uh in antang in kote ii Pathian mai ah kiniamkhiak a, ka khualhawna uh ah hong lampui in, koma, ka tate uh le ka neisa theampo taw hong kep natu ama tungah hesuak ngen tu in ka sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ih khualhaw sungin ngalte khut sung pan hong keam tu in kumpilianpa tungah ngalkapte ka nget tu sia maizum naap khi hi, banghang ziam cile ama munah koma Pathian in ama a muang pawpo thupha pia a, ahizong ama a nungngat pawpo tungah lungkim ngawlin daan a piakna thu ka son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua bangin kote in Pathian hong dal natu an tangin thu ka ngen uh a, kote ii thungetnate ama in hong zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thiampi lampuite sung panin Sherebiah, Hashabiah le a dang sawm ka teal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua zawkciang kumpilianpa, ama ngaisutna a piate le, uliante, tuaciang Israel mite ii Biakinnpi sungah zak tu in a piak ngunn, khamh le vanhzakte toai ka tee a, tua teng thiampite tungah ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hi teng sia amate ka piakte hi: Ngunn - tann 22 Ngunn vanh zakte 100 - kilogramme 70 Khamh - kilogramme 3,400 Khamh khawbeam 20 - kilogramme 8.4 Taau ciitak kuangte 2, kham khawbeam taw a man kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Keima in amate tungah, “Note in na taanghpupite ii Pathian, Topa tungah biakna taw kisai na thiangtho uh bangma in ama kungah thinzaw biakpiakna in na paipui ngunn le khamh vanhzakte zongh thiangtho hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Biakinnpi na thet uh dong tua teng pha takin keamcing tavun. Tua teng thiampite inndoi ah toaitee in Jerusalem ah a om thiampi lampuite, Levi lampuite le Israel te lampuite tungah aap vun,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ahiciang thiampite le Levi te in ngunn, khamh le vanh zakte Jerusalem Biakinnpi ah paipui tu in vaipuak la uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A tha khat tha, ni sawm le ni nii ni in Jerusalem zuan tu in Ahava a kitotawm Tuiluam ka nusia uh hi. Khualhawna ah kote ii Pathian in hong ompui a, ngalte hong simna le hong suam natu panin hong dal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jerusalem ka thet uh ciang, ni thum sung ka tawlnga uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua zawk ni li ni in Biakinnpi ah pai in tua ngunn, khamh le vanh zakte toai ka tee zawkciang in Uriah ii tapa thiampi Meremoth tungah ka aap uh hi. Ama taw in Phinehas ii tapa Eleazar le Levi te nii ahi, Jeshua ii tapa Jozabad le Binnui ii tapa Noadiah zong om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na theampo kisimin toai kitee a, tepteena cing takin kivawt paih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Saltanna pan hong cia kikte theampo in Israel te ii Pathian tungah sangaw biakpiakna a hal tu in biakpiaknate hong paipui uh hi. Amate in Israel mite theampo atu in khuital 12, tuutal 96, le tuuno 77 pia in mawna pan amate le amate a kithiansua natu in keal 12 zongh pia uh hi. Hi ngannote theampo Topa tungah sangaw biakpiakna in hal uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amate in kumpilianpa ii a piak lai sia zongh kengin Euphrates nitumna ngamukmangte le uliante tungah pia a, tuate in mipite le biakinn sung biakpiakna ah huna pia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi teng a kisep zawkciang Israel mite lampui pawlkhat hong pai in, mipite, thiampite le Levi te sia a innpaamte ahi Ammon, Moab le Egypt ngammite sung pan ahizong, Canaan te, Hit te, Periz te, Jebus te le Amor te sung pan ahizong a tuamin a om ngawlna thu ka tungah hong son uh hi. Amate in hi mite ii a vawt a kiihuai nate ma vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jew pate in ngamdang numeite teenpui ahikom Pathian ii mi thiangthote mi thiangtho ngawl suaksak uh hi. A khial belte sia lampuite le uliante veu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi thu ka zaak ciang thinkiam in ka puan ka eaukeak a, ka sam le ka khamul bot in khuangai in ka to cip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khuangai in tualai ah nitak sangaw biakpiak hun dong ka to a, ka kiim ah mipite — a vekpi ka kungah hong kikhawm uh hi, tuate sia saltanna pan a cia kikte ii mawna khialna thu Israel te ii Pathian ii a son hu in a laute ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nitak sangaw biakpiak hun hong thet ciang khuangai in ka omna mun pan thoto in ka puan ek sil lai teng ma taw khupdin in ka khutte laamin Topa ka Pathian tungah thu ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima in, “Pathian awng, na mai ah vandak in ka om tu ka maizum lei hi. Ka mawna uh sia ka lu sang in a saang zawin kiciang a; vantungte a dong tu za in saang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka taanghpupite hun pan tu hun dongin koma, na mite nasia takin maw zo khu hi. Kote mawna hangin koma, ka kumpite le ka thiampite sia ngamdang kumpite khutnuai theng in, hong kisuamin, hong kisuttol a, thongtaak tu in hong kipaipui hi. Tuni ciang dongin maimawl minsiatna ka thuak dikdek lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu in hun tomno sung teng kote Pathian, Topa awng, ko tungah nong thuthiam a, mi pawlkhat sila pan nong suatak a, hi mun thiangthona ah thin muang takin nong teangsak hi. Saltanna pan nong suaktasak a, nuntakna thak nong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kote sila ka hi uh hang saltaangin nong nusia bua hi. Persia kumpiliante in nong ngumsak a, hi lai Judah le Jerusalem ah ngammuanna ka nei thei natu uh le a lalsa na Biakinnpi sa kik tu in nong nungtasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ahizong tu in Pathian awng, tuabang teng a sua zawkciang bang son thei nawn tu khu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kamsaang na naseamte tungtawn a nong thupiakte ka zui bua leleau uh hi. Amate in ka laak tu uh ngam sia thiangtho ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile tualai ah a teang mite in tua ngam mong khat pan mong khat a kiihuai, a thasiathuai ngamtatnate taw kidimsak hi hong ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate hong cina pan, tua ngam sungah nuamsa in na suan na paalte in a tawntung na luasak nuam uh le tua mite taw na kiteangthaang ngei buatu uh a, a khanto natu le a matut natu in hu ngeingawl tu nu hi, hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka mawnate le ka khialnate hangin hiza daan ka thuak zawk uh ciang zong in nangma, kote Pathian in kote thuak tu a kilawm za sangin a tawm zaw nong thuaksak a, nong nuntaksak lai sia he khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahiciang nong thupiakte thu sim ngawl kikin hi mihing seksolte taw kiteang kik thei tu khu ziam? Tuabang ka ngamta uh le na thin uuk mama in khat zongh hong hing khoai ngawlin nong mon siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel ii Topa Pathian awng, nang thutang ni hi, ahihang kote nong nungtasak hi. Ka mawnate na tungah kong pualaak uh hi; na mai ah kong pai natu thu a om bua hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Biakinnpi mai ah Ezra kapin hi mawna khialnate pualaakin kunin a thunget laitak a kiim ah Israel te — pasalte, nupite le patangte — kikhawm a, nasia takin kap uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaciang Elam bee le phung sung pan Jehiel ii tapa Shecaniah in Ezra tungah, “Ngamdang numeite teenpuina hangin Pathian taw ciampeal khu hi, ahitazong Israel atu in lam et om lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu in hi numeite le a tate puak kik natu in ih Pathian tungah a ciliap huai kamciamna khat vawt hamtang tu khu hi. Kote in nangma le Pathian thupiak a zakta dangte ii vawt tu hong ci bangin ka vawt tu uh hi. Pathian Thukham ii ci bangin ka vawt tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuasia in sep tu na vaipuak ahi hi. Kote na nungah om khu hi, tua hi a pai in a, seam suak vet in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Ezra in Shecaniah ii a ci bangin thiampi lampuite, Levi lampuite le a taanglai mihon lampuite sep tu in kiciamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama sia Biakinnpi mai pan pai in Eliashib ii tapa Jehohanan inn sungah tumin zan taam hi, tua munah saltaangte thumaan ngawlnate hangin khuangai in om hi. Ama in bang mama ne ngawl dawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Saltanna pan a cia kik theampo Jerusalem khua ah a kikhop natu thu Jerusalem le Judah ngam mun theampo ah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />mipi lampuite ii thupiak bangin kizasak hi. Ni thum sungin a pai ngawl a om le, a neisa theampo kimatsak tu a, taangpite sungah pawlmi suak thei nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ni thum sung, a tha kuana, ni kul ni in Judah le Benjamin ngam sungah a teang pasal theampo, Jerusalem khua ah pai in biakinn leitual ah kikhawm uh hi. Tua hun sung ngua tam mama zu ahikom khua hun phat ngawl hang le kikhopna a thupina hangin mipi theampo ling vakil uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thiampi Ezra dingto in amate tungah, “Note in upna na nei bua uh a, ngamdang zi na nei uh manin, Israel tungah khialna na tungsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahiciang tu in na taanghpupite ii Pathian, Topa tungah na mawnate pualaak vun a, ama diksak bangin ngamta vun. Ih ngam sungah a teang ngamdangmite kung pan a tuamin om vun a, na ngamdang zite taw kikhen vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mipite au in, “Na ci babangin vawt tu khu hi,” ci in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahizong amate in, “Mihonpi tam leih a, ngua zongh tam mama hi. Hi bangin kote doipua sangah ding zo nawn ngawl tu khu hi. Hi mawna sungah eite tam mama kihel ih hi ciang, ni khat ni nii sungin a kiseam thei tu nasep hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ih uliante Jerusalem ah taamsakin hi thu seam tahen. Tuasia ciang ngamdang zi nei pawpo in a kiciam hunin a khuapi tek pan tuabangin lampuite le a thukhente taw hong paikhawm tahen. Hi bangin sepna taw Pathian ii thin uukna sia thai thei tu hi,” ci thua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi ngealna sia Asahel ii tapa Jonathan le Tikvah ii tapa Jahzeiah te sim ngawlin nial ngawl a, amate sia Melshullam le Levi mi Shabbethai te in panpui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Saltanna pan a cia kikte in tua ngealna sia thukim ahikom thiampi Ezra in bee le phung lutang teng tung pan pasal upate panmun pia in, a min teng khum hi. Amate in a tha sawmna, ni khat ni in a thu kat kipan in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tua zawk tha thum sungin amate in ngamdang zi neite taw kisai thu theampo kan siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hi sia in ngamdang zinei pasalte tepteena hi: Joshua le a suapuite ii bee le phung pan Jehozadak ii tapate: Maaseiah, Eliezer, Jarib le Gedaliah te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in a zite khul tu in kamciam pia a, a mawnate hangin tuutal khat taw sangaw biakpiakna nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Immer bee le phung: Hanani le Zebadiah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Harim bee le phung: Maaseiah, Elijah, Shemaiah, Jehiel le Uzziah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pashhur bee le phung: Elioenai, Maaseiah, Ishmael, Nethanel, Jozabad le Elasah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jozabad, Shimei, Kelaiah, (Kelita zongh kici), Pethahiah, Judah le Eliezer
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Eliashib Shallum, Telem le Uri
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Parosh bee le phung: Ramiah, Izziah, Malchijah, Mijamin, Eleazar, Malchijah le Benaiah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Elam bee le phung: Mattaniah, Zechariah, Jehiel, Abdi, Jeremoth le Elijah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zattu bee le phung: Elioenai, Eliashib, Mattaniah, Jeremoth, Zabad, le Aziza
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bebai bee le phung: Jehohanan, Hananiah, Zabbai le Athlai
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bani bee le phung: Meshullam, Malluch, Adaiah, Jashub, Sheal le Jeremoth
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pahath Moab bee le phung: Adna, Chelal, Benaiah, Maaseiah, Mattaniah, Bezalel, Binnui le Manasseh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Harim bee le phung: Eliezer, Isshijah, Malchijah, Shemaiah, Shimeon, Benjamin, Malluch le Shemariah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hashum bee le phung: Mattenai, Mattattah Zabad, Eliphelet, Jeremai, Manasseh le Shimei
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bani bee le phung: Maadai, Amram, Uel, Benaiah, Bedeiah, Cheluhi, Vaniah, Meremoth, Eliashib, Mattaniah, Mattenai le Jaasu
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Binnui bee le phung: Shimei, Shelemiah, Nathan, Adaiah, Machnadebai, Shashai, Sharai, Azarel, Shelemiah, Shemariah, Shallum, Amariah le Joseph
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nebo bee le phung: Jeiel, Mattithiah, Zabad, Zebina, Jaddai, Joel le Benaiah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hi pasalte theampo ngamdang zineite veu hi. Amate in a zite khulin a tate taw ciasak siat uh hi.
  </para>
</usx>
